            "review_title": "Review at Plov House Halal",
            "review_text": "Kilian F\nShanghai, China17 contributions\n0\nSlow and overcooked\nAug 2024 • Couples\nWe ordered 3 shashliks and one plate of shrimps.\nThe service was terrible : so long around one hour 🙈\nThe shrimps were cold and we had to ask to warm them up.\nThe skewers were overcooked (especially lamb and beef meats, chicken was ok) .\nNot to mention that they took them around 40 minutes to deliver a can of Coca Cola and a glass of juice\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2024\nPlov House Halal\nHi! we are really sorry for you bad experience at our Place, if you are living in Vietnam please write back, we would love to have a second chance to fix that problem. Thank you for your feedback, We will use that as motivation to develop our services\nRead more\nWritten September 9, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
